Oh wow, check this out!

51
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:55,197
Emperors of the sea Kaido and Big
Mom defeated news this massive could

52
00:02:55,280 --> 00:03:00,117
not be contained and It spread across
the world like wildfire the people

53
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:03,517
were clamoring to learn the names of
The three pirate captains who ended

54
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:08,340
the emperor's reign and the world
government was swift in their Judgment,

55
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:11,700
placing an exorbitant bounty on each head.

56
