Three billion berries?

57
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:19,380
Wow, boss. Nice, Captain.

58
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,720
Let me see.

59
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,757
I have got to look at this up close.

60
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,016
Check this part out.

61
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:26,260
Holy crap.

62
00:03:28,620 --> 00:03:30,660
Hey, boss, where are you going?

63
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,557
He's even Pizarro than usual.

64
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:34,357
